---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Email WINKS London · General enquiries" description="Send a general enquiry to WINKS London about locations, experiences, accessibility or reservations.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="page-hero__watermark">NOTE</span><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4 page-hero__content"><div class="breadcrumb-line"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/contact">Contact</a><span>/</span><span class="current">Email WINKS</span></div><span class="eyebrow mt-4">General enquiries</span><h1>Write to<br /><em>WINKS.</em></h1><p>Ask a question, share a location note or tell us the feeling you want from your evening.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--line"><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="content-grid"><div class="form-shell"><div class="form-shell__header"><h2>Email WINKS</h2><span>Private enquiry</span></div><div class="form-shell__body"><form data-demo-form data-success-message="Your enquiry is with the WINKS team. We will reply privately during service hours." novalidate><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="email-name">Your name</label><input class="form-control" id="email-name" name="name" required /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="email-address">Email</label><input class="form-control" id="email-address" name="email" type="email" required /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="email-phone">Phone / WhatsApp (optional)</label><input class="form-control" id="email-phone" name="phone" type="tel" /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="email-topic">Topic</label><select class="form-select" id="email-topic" name="topic" required><option value="" selected disabled>Choose a topic</option><option>Choosing an experience</option><option>Reservation question</option><option>Location / travel</option><option>Accessibility or requirements</option><option>General enquiry</option></select></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label" for="email-message">Your message</label><textarea class="form-control" id="email-message" name="message" rows="7" required placeholder="How can we help?"></textarea></div><div class="col-12"><div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" id="email-consent" type="checkbox" required /><label class="form-check-label" for="email-consent">I would like WINKS to reply to this enquiry.</label></div></div><div class="col-12"><button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Send email enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><div class="col-12"><div class="form-success" data-form-success role="status"></div></div></div></form></div></div><aside class="content-aside"><div class="aside-card"><span class="eyebrow">Prefer a call?</span><h3>+44 (0)20 7118 7118</h3><p>Reception hours: 1PM–2AM. WhatsApp is also available for quick private questions.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-gold w-100" href="tel:+442071187118">Call WINKS</a></div><div class="aside-card"><span class="eyebrow">Fast answers</span><p>For common questions about guests, hours, preparation and privacy, the FAQ is the quickest place to look.</p><a class="text-link" href="/info/faq">Visit the FAQ <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></aside></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
